                        </div>
                        <p class="vk-caption">Success rate by difficulty (Fig. 1), resolution rate per CWE class (Fig. 2), and failure-mode breakdown (Fig. 3). See <a href="#instances">§06</a> for per-instance details.</p>
                    </section>

